*** Add File:ops/runbooks/langflow_ops_runbook.md
+Langflow Secure Deployment & Ops Runbook
+======================================
+
+Overview
+--------
+This runbook describes how to deploy Langflow in a hardened manner and how to operate it within Aegis.
+
+Pre-deploy checklist
+- Create namespace aegis-llm (k8s/langflow/namespace.yaml)
+- Create secrets: langflow-secrets (OIDC client id/secret), EVIDENCE_BUCKET, AWS_KMS_KEY_ID stored in Vault and GitHub secrets
+- Provision PVC langflow-flows-pvc (used to store flows from GitOps)
+
+Deploy steps
+1. Apply namespace and config:
+   kubectl apply -f k8s/langflow/namespace.yaml
+   kubectl apply -f k8s/langflow/langflow-configmap.yaml
+2. Create secrets (example uses Vault to populate langflow-secrets)
+3. Deploy egress proxy and oauth2-proxy:
+   kubectl apply -f k8s/langflow/egress-proxy-deployment.yaml
+   kubectl apply -f k8s/langflow/oauth2-proxy-deployment.yaml
+4. Deploy runhook and langflow:
+   kubectl apply -f k8s/langflow/runhook-configmap.yaml
+   kubectl apply -f k8s/langflow/runhook-deployment.yaml
+   kubectl apply -f k8s/langflow/langflow-deployment.yaml
+   kubectl apply -f k8s/langflow/langflow-service.yaml
+5. Apply NetworkPolicy to restrict egress:
+   kubectl apply -f k8s/langflow/networkpolicy.yaml
+
+Operational guidance
+- Limit UI access: enforce OIDC and RBAC; only allow groups that are trusted to author flows.
+- Evidence capture: ensure runhook service is reachable by Langflow; verify that each execution produces a signed evidence bundle in S3 and an index entry.
+- GitOps: flows directory is the source of truth. Use the langflow_gitops_deploy workflow to synchronize flows into the cluster (operator step).
+- SME review: require PRs adding or changing flows to include SME signoff (see ops/formal/sme/README_SIGNOFF.md).
+- Incident playbook: if leak or misuse suspected, revoke egress proxy allowlist, rotate keys, and invoke legal_hold on evidence artifacts.
+
+Audit & retention
+- All run evidence stored in EVIDENCE_BUCKET and indexed; ensure retention policy & legal_hold process are configured.
+- CI produces signed evaluation_summary artifacts; store them as part of release evidence.
+
